# Route: guide 11 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 31 to 34, 62
# quests, 4.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Wetlands): Dun Modr -> Whelgar's Excavation Site -> Angerfang
# Encampment -> Direforge Hill -> Dun Modr -> Raptor Ridge -> Thelgen Rock ->
# Angerfang Encampment -> Whelgar's Excavation Site -> Menethil Harbor -> Dun
# Modr -> Menethil Harbor -> Dun Modr -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Dark Iron War (303; Dark Iron
# Dwarf 27-28, Dark Iron Tunneler 29-30, Dark Iron Saboteur 28-29, Dark Iron
# Demolitionist 30-31); A Grim Task (304; Balgaras the Foul 34); Death to the
# Dragonmaw (98291; Dragonmaw Reclaimer 30, Dragonmaw Soulbinder, Dragonmaw
# Infiltrator); Defeat Nek'rosh (474; Chieftain Nek'rosh 32).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Fury Runs Deep (378), The Fury Runs Deep (378), Lost
# in the Thicket Things (95647), Fallen in the Fen (95795), Heartwoven
# (95809), Highland Hides (98815), Highland Hides (98815), Prehistoric Prism
# (98824), Prehistoric Prism (98824).

